 "許": "تَحْتَ (Beneath; below; at or to the bottom of, or the area covered or surmounted by.) / تَحْتَ (Less than.)  [under (guidance, supervision, rules, the law, etc.)]\noft. as ...の下に or ...の下で\nمثال: 法のもとではすべての人は平等だ。\n→ All men are equal under the law. / تَحْتَ (Beneath; below; at or to the bottom of, or the area covered or surmounted by.) / تَحْتَ (Less than.)  [under (a flag, the sun, etc.)] / مَعَ (In the company of; alongside, close to; near to.) / بِـ (In addition to; as an accessory to.) / بِـ (Using as an instrument; by means of.)  [with (e.g. one blow)]\nas ...の下に / جَانِب (A bounding straight edge of a two-dimensional shape.) / جَانِب (One half (left or right, top or bottom, front or back, etc.) of something or som) / صَفْحَة (One surface of a sheet of paper (used instead of \"page\", which can mean one or b)  [(someone's) side]\nusu. written as 元",
 "許し": "إِبْرَاء, إِعْفَاء (Forgiveness for an offence.) / عَفْو, صَفْح (An order that releases a convicted criminal without further punishment, prevents) / عَفَا (To grant an official pardon for a crime.) / عَفْواً!, مَاذَا قُلْتَ؟ (Often used when someone does not understand what another person says.)  [pardon]\nمثال: 失礼をお許し下さい。\n→ Please excuse me for being rude.",
 "許す": "أَذِنَ, سَمَحَ (To allow (something) to happen, to give permission for.) / رُخْصَة (an artifact or document rendering something allowed or legal) / رُخُصَة (an artifact or document rendering something allowed or legal)  [to permit]\nocc. written as 聴す\nمثال: ＤＮＡのサンプルを貯える事は許されるべきではない。\n→ It shouldn't be permitted to store samples of DNA. / سَامَحَ ((''transitive'') to pardon) / غَفَرَ ((''transitive'') to pardon)  [to forgive]\nalso written as 赦す\nمثال: あなたが後悔しているのなら許してあげよう。\n→ As you are sorry, I'll forgive you. / أَطْلَقَ سَرَاح, حَرَّرَ (To free or liberate; to set free.)  [to release]\nalso written as 赦す / شَكَرَ (to own with gratitude)  [to acknowledge]",
