 "誤る": "أَخْطَأَ (To err, to be wrong. (This entry is a translation hub.))  [to make a mistake (in)]\nمثال: 彼は判断を誤った。\n→ He erred in his judgement. / [to be wrong ; to be incorrect]\nas 誤った or 誤っている\nمثال: 戦争は誤った政策から起こった。\n→ The war resulted from a mistaken policy. / أَضَلَّ (To lead astray, in a false direction.)  [to mislead]\nمثال: 私の判断を誤らすな。\n→ Don't mislead me.",
