 "誤用": "تَعَسُّف, طُغْيَان (Improper treatment or usage; application to a wrong or bad purpose; an unjust, c) / مَسَبَّة, شَتِيمَة (Coarse, insulting speech; abusive language; language that unjustly or angrily vi) / إِيذَاء جَسَدِيّ (Physical maltreatment; injury; cruel treatment.) / اِنْتِهَاك جَسَدِيّ (Violation; defilement; rape; forcing of undesired sexual activity by one person ) / أَسَاءَ اِسْتِعْمَالَ (To put to a wrong use; to misapply; to use improperly; to use for a wrong purpos) / آذَى (To injure; to maltreat; to hurt; to treat with cruelty, especially repeatedly.) / أَهَانَ, سَبَّ (To attack with coarse language; to insult; to revile; malign; to speak in an off) / اِغْتَصَبَ, اِنْتَهَكَ (To violate; defile; to rape; (reflexive) to masturbate.) / خَدَعَ, غَشَّ (To deceive; to trick; to impose on; misuse the confidence of.)  [abuse]\nمثال: その語は誤用されやすい。\n→ The word lends itself to misuse by beginners.",
