 "足らず": "أَصْغَر مِن, صُغْرَى مِن (The character <, used to show that one amount or number is smaller than another.)  [less than]\nafter an amount\nمثال: 彼はせいぜい１００ドル足らずしか持っていない。\n→ He has a hundred dollars at most. / نَقْص, عَدَم وُجُود (A deficiency or need (of something desirable or necessary); an absence, want, de)  [lacking]\nafter a noun\nمثال: 彼のビジネスプランは立派だけど、勘定あって銭足らず、という気もするけどね。\n→ His business plan looks good on paper but I get the feeling it would never work in practice.",
