 "辻君": "دَاعِرَة, بَغِيَّة (A person who does, or offers to do, a demeaning or dishonourable activity for mo) / دَعِرَ, بَغَى (To offer (oneself or someone else) for sexual activity in exchange for money.)  [prostitute]",
 "辻強盗": "قاطِعُ طَرِيق, قُطّاعُ ٱلطُّرُق (A person, usually mounted on horseback, who robbed travelers on public roads.)  [highwayman]",
 "辻褄": "اِتِّسَاق (Reliability or uniformity; the quality of being consistent.) / اِتِّسَاق (Freedom from contradiction; the state of a system of axioms such that none of th)  [consistency]\nمثال: 統計の数字を理論とつじつまの合うように変える。\n→ I accommodate statistics to theory.",
 "込み": "[including ... ; inclusive of ...]\nمثال: それは朝食込みの値段ですか。\n→ Does that price include breakfast? / [bundling together (items of different size, quality, etc.) ; lumping together] / كُومِي (A republic of Russia. Official name: Komi Republic.)  [komi]\nusu. コミ",
 "込みあがる": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise]\nnon-standard form of 込み上げる\nمثال: 久しぶりに故郷に帰ると、懐かしい気持ちが込み上がる。\n→ Returning to your hometown after a long time fills you with nostalgia.",
