 "込み上がる": "نَهَضَ, اِرْتَفْعَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.) / أَشْرَقَ, شَرَقَ (To move, or appear to move, physically upwards relative to the ground.)  [to rise]\nnon-standard form of 込み上げる\nمثال: 久しぶりに故郷に帰ると、懐かしい気持ちが込み上がる。\n→ Returning to your hometown after a long time fills you with nostalgia.",
