 "込める": "حِمْل (A burden; a weight to be carried.) / حِمْل (The electrical current or power delivered by a device.) / عَبَّأَ, شَحَنَ (To put a load on or in (a means of conveyance or a place of storage).)  [to load (a gun, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼はこの銃に弾丸を込めたままにしている。\n→ He keeps this gun loaded. / [to put into (e.g. emotion, effort)]\nمثال: 彼女のテクニックはすばらしいが、もっと感情を込めて演奏する必要がある。\n→ Her technique is superb, but she needs to play with more expression. / تضمن (To enclose, confine.)  [to include (e.g. tax in a sales price)]\nمثال: 新憲法には、王権を弱める意図が込められていました。\n→ The new constitution included the aim of abridging the king's power. / كفن (Especially, the dress for the dead; a winding sheet.)  [to shroud]",
 "込め物": "حُزْمَة, عُبُوَّة (A bundle made up and prepared to be carried; especially, a bundle to be carried ) / وَضَّبَ (to put things together for storage or transporting) / حَزَمَ (to put things together for storage or transporting)  [packing (material)] / أَثَاث, مَفْرُوشَات (Large movable item(s), usually in a room, which enhance(s) the room's characteri)  [furniture]",
