 "込物": "حُزْمَة, عُبُوَّة (A bundle made up and prepared to be carried; especially, a bundle to be carried ) / وَضَّبَ (to put things together for storage or transporting) / حَزَمَ (to put things together for storage or transporting)  [packing (material)] / أَثَاث, مَفْرُوشَات (Large movable item(s), usually in a room, which enhance(s) the room's characteri)  [furniture]",
