 "辿り着く": "بَلَغَ (To extend, stretch, or thrust out (for example a limb or object held in the hand)  [to reach (at last)]\nمثال: 私達はついに頂上へたどり着いた。\n→ At last, we reached the summit.",
 "辿る": "تَبِعَ, اِتَّبَعَ (To go or come after in a sequence.) / اِتَّبَعَ (To carry out (orders, instructions, etc.).) / اِتَّبَعَ (To live one's life according to (religion, teachings, etc).) / تَابَعَ, تَتَبَّعَ (To watch, to keep track of (reports of) some event or person.) / تَابَعَ (To subscribe to see content from an account on a social media platform.)  [to follow (a road, path, etc.)]\nمثال: 森の中の小道を辿っていくのは楽しいことだ。\n→ It's fun to follow the path through the woods. / تَبِعَ, اِتَّبَعَ (To go or come after in a sequence.) / اِتَّبَعَ (To carry out (orders, instructions, etc.).) / اِتَّبَعَ (To live one's life according to (religion, teachings, etc).) / تَابَعَ, تَتَبَّعَ (To watch, to keep track of (reports of) some event or person.) / تَابَعَ (To subscribe to see content from an account on a social media platform.)  [to follow (a clue, scent, tracks, plot, etc.)]\nمثال: 猟師は熊の足跡をたどった。\n→ The hunter followed the bear's tracks. / أَخَذَ (To get into one's hands, possession, or control, with or without force.) / أَخَذَ بِـ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / اِتَّخَذَ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / أَخَذَ (To receive or accept (something, especially something which was given).) / أَخَذَ (To grasp or grip.) / اِسْتَغْرَقَ (To fill or require: to last or expend (an amount of time).)  [to take (a course)]\nمثال: 彼の人気は下降線をたどっている。\n→ His popularity is falling.",
 "迂叟": "أَي, إِي (The name of the Latin script letter I/i.)  [I]\nused by the elderly",
 "迂愚": "غَبِيّ (Without intelligence.) / غَبِيّ, أَحْمَق (A stupid person; a fool.)  [stupid]",
 "迂拙": "[poor and careless way of living] / أَي, إِي (The name of the Latin script letter I/i.)  [I]",
