 "近よる": "اِقْتَرَبَ (To come or go near, in place or time; to move toward; to advance nearer; to draw) / اِقْتِرَاب, مُقَارَبَة (An act of drawing near in place or time; an advancing or coming near.) / كَيْفِيَّة, طَرِيقَة (A manner of making (a policy) or solving (a problem, etc.).)  [to approach]\nمثال: 彼は彼女に近寄って握手をした。\n→ He went up to her and they shook hands.",
