 "近似値": "تَقْرِيب (The act, process or result of approximating, as:)  [approximation]",
 "近傍": "جِوَار, قُرْب (The residential area near one's home.) / حَيّ (A formal or informal division of a municipality or region.) / جِوَار (The quality of being a neighbor, of living nearby, next to each other; proximity)  [neighborhood]",
 "近回り": "جِوَار, قُرْب (The residential area near one's home.) / حَيّ (A formal or informal division of a municipality or region.) / جِوَار (The quality of being a neighbor, of living nearby, next to each other; proximity)  [neighborhood]",
