 "近接": "قرب (Closeness; the state of being near in space, time, or relationship.)  [proximity]\nمثال: ＡへはＢから近接ことができる。\n→ Access to A is available from B. / اِقْتَرَبَ (To come or go near, in place or time; to move toward; to advance nearer; to draw) / اِقْتِرَاب, مُقَارَبَة (An act of drawing near in place or time; an advancing or coming near.) / كَيْفِيَّة, طَرِيقَة (A manner of making (a policy) or solving (a problem, etc.).)  [approaching]",
