 "近東": "شَرْق أَدْنَى (The geographic region of Western Asia located southeast of Eastern Europe, compr)  [Near East]\nمثال: フォークは、ヨーロッパや近東地域で長年にわたって使われていたが、それはもっぱら調理用にのみであった。\n→ Forks were used for many years in Europe and the Near East, but only for cooking.",
 "近点角": "شُذُوذ (A deviation from a rule or from what is regarded as normal; an outlier.) / شُذُوذ (Something or someone that is strange or unusual.) / عَيْب خِلْقِيّ (A defect or malformation.)  [anomaly]",
 "近点離角": "شُذُوذ (A deviation from a rule or from what is regarded as normal; an outlier.) / شُذُوذ (Something or someone that is strange or unusual.) / عَيْب خِلْقِيّ (A defect or malformation.)  [anomaly]",
