 "返咲き": "رِيمُونْتَادَا (An occurrence of an athlete or sports team in a competition overcoming a substan)  [comeback (e.g. in business)] / [second blooming (in a season) ; reflowering]",
 "返報": "ثَأْر, اِنْتِقَام (Any form of personal, retaliatory action against an individual, institution, or ) / اِنْتَقَمَ (To take revenge for (a particular harmful action) or on behalf of (its victim); )  [revenge] / رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [return (of a favour)] / أَجَابَ, رَدَّ (To give a written or spoken response, especially to a question, request, accusat) / إِجَابَة, جَوَاب (A written or spoken response; part of a conversation.)  [reply]",
 "返戻": "رَجَعَ, عَادَ (To come or go back (to a place or person).) / أَرْجَعَ, أَعَادَ (To give something back to its original holder or owner.) / عَوْدَة (The act of returning.)  [returning]",
