 "迷う": "اُغْرُب عَن وَجْهِي!, إِبْتَعِد عَنِّي! (Used to rudely tell somebody to go away or leave one alone.) / ضَلَّ الطَّرِيق (To lose one's way.)  [to get lost]\nمثال: 彼は森の中で迷った。\n→ He lost his way in the woods. / تَرَدَّدَ (To stop or pause respecting decision or action; to be in suspense or uncertainty)  [to hesitate]\nمثال: どの道を行くか迷った。\n→ I hesitated about which road to take. / [to be captivated (by) ; to be infatuated (with)]\nمثال: 彼女の色香に迷った。\n→ He was fascinated with her beauty. / [to linger (of a departed soul) ; to be restless in one's grave]",
