 "迷宮": "مَتَاهَة (A maze-like structure built by Daedalus in Knossos, containing the Minotaur.)  [labyrinth]\nمثال: 四天王も倒した、クソ長い地下迷宮もクリアした。\n→ I'd defeated the four sub-bosses and got through the damn long underground labyrinth. / سِرّ (Something secret or unexplainable; an unknown.) / غُمُوض (Someone or something with an obscure or puzzling nature.)  [mystery] / زِنْزَانَة, دَيْمَاس (An underground prison or vault, typically built underneath a castle.)  [dungeon]",
