 "追っ掛け": "طَارَدَ (To pursue.)  [chase] / [chase scene (in a movie)] / [obsessive fan who follows a celebrity around ; groupie]\nمثال: アイドルのコンサート会場に、追っかけのファンがウジャウジャ集まっていた。\n→ At the pop star's concert the fans were swarming around the foot of the stage. / قَرِيبًا, سَرْعَانَ مَا (Within a short time; quickly.)  [soon (after)]",
