 "通用": "اِسْتِعْمَال, اِسْتِخْدَام (The act of using.) / اِسْتَعْمَلَ, اِسْتَخْدَمَ (To utilize or employ.)  [(common) use (of a language, currency, etc.)] / عَمَل, شُغْل (Employment.) / مُصَنَّف, مُؤَلَّف (Product; the result of effort.) / سَارَ (To be operative in a specified way.)  [to work (of an excuse, trick, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は年の割に若く見えるので、大学生として通用します。\n→ He looks so young for his age that he passes for a college student. / [going in and out ; entrance and exit]",
 "通知": "لَاحَظَ (To remark upon; to mention.) / لَاحَظَ, اِنْتَبَهَ (To become aware of; to observe.)  [notice]\nمثال: おって通知があるまで待て。\n→ Wait until further notice. / إِشْعَار, إِخْطَار (The act of notifying.) / تَنْبِيه, إِشْعَار (A specific piece of information that serves to notify.)  [notification (on a smartphone, PC, etc.)]",
