 "逝去": "مَوْت (cessation of life) / وَفَاة (cessation of life) / هَلَاك (cessation of life) / مَنِيَّة (cessation of life) / حِمَام (cessation of life) / موت (cessation of life)  [death]\nمثال: ご尊父のご逝去に対し、謹んで哀悼の意を表します。\n→ Please accept my condolences on the death of your father.",
 "逞しい": "قَوِيّ (Capable of producing great physical force.) / مَنِيع, مَتِيْن (Capable of withstanding great physical force.) / قَوِيّ, راسِخ (Determined; unyielding.) / شَدِيْد, قَوْيّ (Highly stimulating to the senses.) / شَدِيْد (Having an offensive or intense odor or flavor.) / حَادّ, ثَقِيْل (Having a high concentration of an essential or active ingredient.) / بِقُوَّة (In a strong manner.)  [strong]\nمثال: 骨格たくましい体格なので彼は柔道家でとおっている。\n→ With his muscular constitution he passes for a judoist. / لَا يَتْعَبُ (Extremely persistent and untiring.)  [indefatigable]\nمثال: 彼女は逞しく逆境に耐えた。\n→ She bore her misfortunes with a brave spirit. / قَوِيّ (Evincing strength and health; strong; (often, especially) both large and healthy)  [robust (vitality, appetite, economic growth, etc.)]\nمثال: 彼は想像力のたくましい少年であった。\n→ He used to be an imaginative boy.",
 "速": "سُرْعَة (The state of moving quickly or the capacity for rapid motion.) / سُرْعَة (The rate of motion or action, specifically the magnitude of the velocity; the ra)  [speed (e.g. 4-speed transmission)]\nمثال: オプションとして４速自動変速機も選べる。\n→ 4-speed automatic transmission is available as an option.",
 "速い": "عميق (Deep or sound (of sleep); fast asleep (of people).) / بِسُرْعَة, عَاجِلًا (Quickly, with great speed; within a short time .) / صَامَ (To cause (a person or animal) to abstain, especially from eating.)  [fast]\nesp. 速い\nمثال: あれは世界で最も速い電車です。\n→ That is the fastest train in the world. / سَهْل (Requiring little skill or effort.)  [easy]\nesp. 早い / [as soon as ... ; the moment ...]\nas ...するが早いか or ...するより早く",
 "速く": "بِسُرْعَة, عَاجِلًا (Rapidly; with speed; fast; with expedition.)  [quickly]\nesp. 速く\nمثال: あなたが早くよくなるように祈っています。\n→ We are hoping for your quick recovery.",
 "速さ": "سُرْعَة (The state of moving quickly or the capacity for rapid motion.) / سُرْعَة (The rate of motion or action, specifically the magnitude of the velocity; the ra)  [speed]\nesp. 速さ\nمثال: エイズウイルスの拡散は恐るべき速さで進んでいる。\n→ The speed of the spread of AIDS is horrifyingly fast. / [earliness]\nesp. 早さ",
 "速まる": "أَحْيَا (Senses relating to life or states of activity.) / سَرَّعَ (Senses relating to speed.)  [to quicken]\nesp. 速まる\nمثال: 心臓の鼓動が速まった。\n→ My heart quickened.",
 "速め": "بَاكِر (At a time in advance of the usual or expected event.) / مُبَكِّرًا, بَاكِرًا (At a time before expected; sooner than usual.)  [early]\nesp. 早め\nمثال: 早めの返事をお待ちしております。\n→ I look forward to hearing from you soon. / [a little faster than usual ; slightly quicker]\nesp. 速め",
 "速める": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [to advance]\nusu. 早める\nمثال: その薬が成長の過程を早めた。\n→ The medicine hastened the process of growth. / أَحْيَا (Senses relating to life or states of activity.) / سَرَّعَ (Senses relating to speed.)  [to quicken (e.g. one's step)]\nusu. 速める\nمثال: 我々はふだんより足を速めて歩いた。\n→ We walked more quickly than usual.",
 "速やか": "سَرِيع (Moving with speed, rapidity or swiftness, or capable of doing so; rapid; fast.) / سَرِيعٌ (Occurring in a short time; happening or done rapidly.) / حَيٌّ (Alive, living.) / جَارٍ (Pregnant, especially at the stage where the foetus's movements can be felt; figu) / سَرِيعًا, بِسُرْعَةٍ (Quickly, in a quick manner.)  [quick]\nمثال: 決定の後すみやかに実行に移して欲しい。\n→ I want quick action subsequent to the decision.",
 "速わかり": "[quick understanding ; catching on quickly] / مُرْشِد, مُرْشِد سِيَاحِيّ (Someone who guides, especially someone hired to show people around a place or an) / دَلِيل (A document or book that offers information or instruction; guidebook.) / دَلَّ, هَدَى (To serve as a guide for someone or something; to lead or direct in a way; to con)  [(beginner's) guide]\nusu. in titles",
 "速分かり": "[quick understanding ; catching on quickly] / مُرْشِد, مُرْشِد سِيَاحِيّ (Someone who guides, especially someone hired to show people around a place or an) / دَلِيل (A document or book that offers information or instruction; guidebook.) / دَلَّ, هَدَى (To serve as a guide for someone or something; to lead or direct in a way; to con)  [(beginner's) guide]\nusu. in titles",
