 "速度": "سُرْعَة (The state of moving quickly or the capacity for rapid motion.) / سُرْعَة (The rate of motion or action, specifically the magnitude of the velocity; the ra)  [speed]\nمثال: その男は一定の速度で車を運転した。\n→ The man drove his car at a uniform speed. / [velocity]",
 "速度制限": "حَدّ اَلسُّرْعَة اَلْأُقْصَى, حَدّ اَلسُّرْعَة (The maximum speed permitted by law for vehicles.)  [speed limit]",
