 "速目": "بَاكِر (At a time in advance of the usual or expected event.) / مُبَكِّرًا, بَاكِرًا (At a time before expected; sooner than usual.)  [early]\nesp. 早め\nمثال: 早めの返事をお待ちしております。\n→ I look forward to hearing from you soon. / [a little faster than usual ; slightly quicker]\nesp. 速め",
