 "連ねる": "[to line up ; to put in a row] / جَمَعَ (To sum up; to put together mentally; to add up.) / أَضَافَ (To append (e.g. a statement); to say further information.) / أَضَافَ (To intensify; to augment; to increase.) / أَضَافَ (To add someone as a friend.)  [to add (to a group)] / وَصْلَة (One element of a chain or other connected series.)  [to link] / [to take along with ; to bring with]",
