 "進む": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [to advance (spatially)]\nمثال: 彼は人混みをかき分けて進んだ。\n→ He made his way through the crowd. / سَبَقَ, سَلَفَ (To go before, go in front of.)  [to precede]\nمثال: あなたは理科系の大学に進んだほうがいいよ。\n→ You should go on to a technical college. / تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To proceed with (doing an activity); to prolong (an activity).) / تَابَعَ, اِسْتَمَرَّ (To resume.)  [to continue]\nمثال: 仕事は着々と進んでいる。\n→ The work is progressing steadily. / نَمَى ((intransitive) to become bigger) / كَبُرَ ((intransitive) to become bigger)  [to grow]\nمثال: インフレの程度が進むにつれてドルの価値は下がる。\n→ The value of the dollar declines as the rate of inflation rises.",
 "進める": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [to advance]\nمثال: ナポレオンは軍隊をロシアに進めた。\n→ Napoleon marched his armies into Russia. / أَبْعَد, أَقْصَى (More distant; relatively distant.)  [to further]\nمثال: その計画は進められている。\n→ The project is underway. / رَفَعَ (to cause to rise)  [to raise]",
 "進め方": "اِجْرَاء (The set of established forms or methods of an organized body for accomplishing a)  [procedure]\nمثال: 彼は仕事の進め方について明確な考えを持っていない。\n→ He has no distinct idea of how to proceed.",
 "進んで": "طَوْعًا, طَوَاعِيَةً (Of one’s own free will; freely and spontaneously.)  [willingly]\nمثال: 進んで学ぼうとする気の無い者には教える甲斐がない。\n→ One who is not willing to learn is not worth teaching.",
 "進上": "مِعْطَاء (Having the tendency to give; generous.)  [giving]",
 "進上物": "هَدِيَّة, هدية (Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.) / قَرِيحَة (A talent or natural ability.) / أَهْدَى (To give as a gift or donation.)  [gift]",
 "進入": "إِدْخَال (The act of entering.) / وُلُوج, نَفَاذ (Permission to enter.) / مَدْخَل, دُخُول (A doorway that provides a means of entering a building.) / مَدْخَل, مُدْخَل (An item in a list, such as an article in a dictionary or encyclopedia.) / دَفْتَر, مَدْخَل (A record made in a log, diary or anything similarly organized; (computing) a dat)  [entry]\nمثال: 右から進入して来る車にはいつも道を譲りなさい。\n→ Always give way to traffic coming from the right.",
 "進入禁止": "مَمْنُوع الدُّخُولُ (Used on signs to indicate that entry into the area where the sign is displayed i)  [No Entry]\non signage",
 "進出": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [advance (into a new market, industry, etc.)]\nمثال: その会社は中国への進出を目指している。\n→ The company aims to branch out into China. / يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [advance (to the next round of a competition)]\nمثال: 私達は決勝戦に進出した。\n→ We advanced to the finals.",
 "進化": "تَطَوُّر (Process of development.)  [evolution]\nمثال: 絶滅は進化の一部である。\n→ Extinction is part of evolution. / تَطَوُّر (Process of development.)  [evolution]",
 "進化を遂げる": "طَوَّرَ (To progress through a sequence of stages.)  [to develop]",
 "進化生物学": "علم الأحياء التطوري (A subfield of biology concerned with the origin and descent of species and as th)  [evolutionary biology]",
 "進化発生学": "علم الأحياء النمائي التطوري (A branch of biology that studies the interaction of evolutionary and development)  [evolutionary developmental biology]",
 "進化的に安定な戦略": "إِس (name of the letter S, s)  [ESS]",
 "進化論": "نَظَرِيَّة التَّطَوُّر (A theory of evolution, especially the scientific theory of evolution through nat)  [evolutionary theory]\nمثال: このことを背景知識として、ここで進化論生物学の現状についての考察に移ろう。\n→ With this as background I turn now to an account of the present state of evolutionary biology.",
 "進取": "مُغَامَرَة, شَرِكَة (A company, business, organization, or other purposeful endeavor.)  [enterprising]\nمثال: その困難に打ち勝つには進取の精神が必要だ。\n→ We need a spirit of enterprise to overcome the difficulty.",
 "進取的": "مُغَامَرَة, شَرِكَة (A company, business, organization, or other purposeful endeavor.)  [enterprising]",
 "進呈": "إِرَاءَة (The act of presenting, or something presented.) / إِهْدَاء, مَنْح (A lecture or speech given in front of an audience.)  [presentation (e.g. of a gift)]",
 "進塁": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [advance (to the next base)]",
 "進境": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]",
 "進展": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]\nمثال: その事件の進展について逐一知らせてください。\n→ Please keep me informed of the development of the case.",
 "進度": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]",
 "進捗": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]",
 "進撃": "يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [advance]\nمثال: 軍隊は敵に向かって進撃した。\n→ The army advanced on the enemy.",
 "進攻": "هُجُوم m هَجْمَة (attempt to cause damage, injury, or death) / حَمْلَة (attempt to cause damage, injury, or death) / هَاجَمَ (To apply violent force to someone or something.)  [attack]",
 "進数": "قَاعِدَة (A site, structure, or both, usually durable and often permanent, for housing mil) / قَاعِدَة, مَرْكَز (The place where decisions for an organization are made; headquarters.) / قَاعِدَة (The lowest side of a triangle or other polygon, or the lowest face of a cone, py) / يُبْنَى عَلَى, يَسْتَنِدُ إِلَى (To give as its foundation or starting point; to lay the foundation of.) / شائع (Of low social standing or rank; vulgar, common.) / منخفض, فاسق (Morally reprehensible, immoral; cowardly.) / دنيء (Inferior; unworthy, of poor quality.)  [(number) base (e.g. 10)]",
 "進歩": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]\nمثال: 科学の進歩は止まることがない。\n→ Advance in science is continuous.",
 "進歩性": "اِخْتِرَاع (Something invented.)  [invention (with respect to prior art)]",
 "進歩的": "تَقَدُّمِيّ, تَقَدُّمِيّ (One with liberal or progressive political beliefs.)  [progressive]\nمثال: ホワイト氏は進歩的な政治家だ。\n→ Mr. White is a liberal politician.",
 "進水": "أَطْلَقَ, قَذَفَ (To throw (a projectile such as a lance, dart or ball); to hurl; to propel with f)  [(ship's) launching]\nمثال: 新しいオイル・タンカーが進水した。\n→ A new oil tanker was launched.",
 "進物": "هَدِيَّة, هدية (Something given to another voluntarily, without charge.) / قَرِيحَة (A talent or natural ability.) / أَهْدَى (To give as a gift or donation.)  [gift]\nمثال: 多くの実業家たちは政府の役人にとり入るために、進物や金を惜しげもなくあたえる。\n→ Many businessmen, in order to curry favor with government officials, will shower them with gifts and money.",
 "進物所": "[palace kitchen in which final preparations to the imperial family's meals (e.g…] / مَطْبَخ (room)  [kitchen (in a noble's manor)]",
 "進発": "نَجْمَة, اِبْتِدَاء (The beginning of an activity.) / نَجْمَة (The beginning point of a race, a board game, etc.) / بَدَأَ (To begin, commence, initiate.)  [start]",
 "進級": "تَرْقِيَة, تَرْفِيع (An advancement in rank or position.) / تَرْوِيج (Dissemination of information in order to increase its popularity.) / تَرْقِيَة (Transformation of a pawn into a piece (by reaching the opponent's back rank).)  [promotion (school, military, etc.)]",
 "進行": "[moving forward (e.g. of a vehicle) ; onward movement] / تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress (of work, activities, etc.)]\nمثال: その仕事は現在進行しています。\n→ The work is now in progress. / مُتَتَالِيَة (A sequence obtained by adding or multiplying each term by a constant.)  [progression (of a disease, global warming, etc.)]\nمثال: このころ、病気の進行は遅くなった。\n→ About this time, the disease slowed. / مُتَتَالِيَة (A sequence obtained by adding or multiplying each term by a constant.)  [progression (e.g. chord progression)]",
 "進行中": "عَلَى قَدَم وَسَاق (In motion; in action; astir; stirring; in progress.)  [afoot]\nمثال: 新しい橋の建設が進行中だ。\n→ The new bridge is in process of construction.",
 "進行性": "تَقَدُّمِيّ, تَقَدُّمِيّ (One with liberal or progressive political beliefs.)  [progressive (worsening disease or condition)]",
