 "進路": "طَرِيق, مَسار (A course or way which is traveled or passed.)  [route]\nمثال: どの進路を選んでも危険が待ち受けている。\n→ Whichever way we choose will involve danger. / [one's future course (e.g. after graduating high school)]\nمثال: 進路のことで先生に助言を求めた。\n→ I asked my teacher for advice on my future course.",
