 "進運": "تَقَدُّم (Specifically, advancement to a higher or more developed state; development, grow) / تَقَدُّم (Movement onwards, forwards, or towards a specific objective or direction; advanc)  [progress]",
 "進達": "صَاعِدًا (Into the future.) / مُهَاجِم (One of the eight players (comprising two props, one hooker, two locks, two flank)  [forwarding (to a higher authority, proper office, etc.)] / يقرب (To move forward in space or time.)  [advance]",
 "進駐": "وَظِيفَة, مِهْنَة (An activity or task with which one occupies oneself; usually specifically the pr) / اِحْتِلال, إِشْغَال (The control of a nation or region by a hostile military or paramilitary force.)  [occupation]",
