 "逸話": "نَادِرَة (short account of an incident) / أُطْرُوفَة (short account of an incident) / أُفْكُوهَة (short account of an incident) / طُرْفَة (short account of an incident) / فُكَاهَة (short account of an incident) / لَطِيفَة (short account of an incident)  [anecdote]\nمثال: 彼はまずユーモアのある逸話を話して講義を始めた。\n→ He began his lecture with a humorous anecdote.",
