 "逼塞": "[being trapped (and having no way out)] / [withdrawal from society during personal financial hardship] / إِقَامَة جَبْرِيَّة (Confinement of a person to his or her residence, sometimes with a limited travel)  [house arrest (Edo period)]",
 "逼迫": "ضَغْط (A pressing; a force applied to a surface.) / ضَغْط (The amount of force that is applied over a given area divided by the size of thi)  [pressure]\nمثال: 国家財政は厳しく逼迫している。\n→ The government finances are severely squeezed. / [being strained (of a situation) ; being tense]",
